WEBVTT

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:06.790
On that day, like what all passionate soccer players yearn for,

00:00:06.790 --> 00:00:11.020
we stood on the pitch of FC Barcelona's Camp Nou.

00:00:15.930 --> 00:00:19.670
There, by playing our own unique brand of soccer,

00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:22.470
we shocked the whole world!

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:57.830
All right! Let's find three more players!

00:01:57.830 --> 00:02:00.400
Then we can start practicing for real!

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:01.330
Shou-kun.

00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:01.770
Huh?

00:02:01.770 --> 00:02:05.270
We never said we were going to keep on playing.

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:08.070
We have to prepare for our 
middle school entrance exams, too.

00:02:08.070 --> 00:02:12.680
It's great that the Furuyas came back and joined our team,

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:16.120
but we need a proper coach, or else we won't go anywhere!

00:02:16.120 --> 00:02:18.850
That's that. Later.

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:25.160
No way! You're kidding me!

00:02:31.600 --> 00:02:35.830
I thought we could build up some momentum,

00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:38.840
but everything just went cold.

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:45.210
Everyone still wants to play soccer, though.

00:02:45.210 --> 00:02:49.980
We just need a little something and the team will be complete.

00:02:50.050 --> 00:02:52.850
But we need a proper coach, or else we won't go anywhere!

00:02:52.850 --> 00:02:55.490
You don't have a coach, either.

00:02:55.490 --> 00:02:59.660
Sorry about that. I'm still an active player, 
so I can't coach an elementary school team.

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:02.130
Then please be our coach.

00:03:02.130 --> 00:03:05.000
Kota-kun, don't ask for the impossible.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:07.200
So we need a coach, huh?

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:10.940
But <i>that</i> is the biggest problem.

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:19.080
Good morning.

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:26.050
Morning.

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:33.190
Who's that?

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:42.070
The coach can't be just anyone.

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:47.310
Misaki-san did say we'd surely meet an excellent coach, but...{Misaki-san would've been perfect, but...}

00:03:48.110 --> 00:03:49.740
Erika-chan! Good morning!

00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:51.210
Good morning.

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:53.880
As always, you're really loud early in the morning.{You're just as loud so early in the morning.}

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:56.520
That's my only good point.

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:57.980
I'm not complimenting you.

00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:01.350
Hey, about yesterday...

00:04:01.350 --> 00:04:03.690
The Momoyama Predators...

00:04:03.690 --> 00:04:06.130
I already talked about it back then.

00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:09.130
Please! I couldn't find anyone else!

00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:11.360
You're the only one left!

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:15.100
Shou's hitting on the transfer student again!

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:17.400
Did he get her?

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:18.240
You idiots!

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:21.870
My only love is Ronaldo-sama!

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:24.810
Enough of this crap!

00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:26.910
S-Sorry!

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:30.620
Anyway, I won't join a team which doesn't have a coach.

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:33.350
I want to get even better.

00:04:33.350 --> 00:04:36.420
We need those triplets, at the very least.

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:39.490
Misaki-san should be our coach.

00:04:39.490 --> 00:04:41.930
You're still going on about that?{You can't think of anyone else?}

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:43.730
Um...

00:04:43.730 --> 00:04:46.470
Shou-kun seems pretty serious about this.

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:48.300
Yeah, I guess.

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:51.140
Erika-chan's looking for a team.

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:52.640
Yeah, that's right.

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:56.940
Then why don't you two go look for a coach together?

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:58.480
Yes! That's it!

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:00.550
Reika-chan's right!

00:05:00.550 --> 00:05:02.410
Why are you getting so hyped up?

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:04.920
I don't have the time to play around.

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:07.790
Then let's decide this with soccer.

00:05:07.790 --> 00:05:09.790
You're not listening at all.

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:12.190
I've already won, then.

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:14.590
We have to play first.

00:05:14.590 --> 00:05:17.160
I've been practicing everyday, too.

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:20.970
You sure are stubborn.

00:05:20.970 --> 00:05:25.100
I'll decide the rules, then.

00:05:26.370 --> 00:05:27.940
Let's go! Let's go!

00:05:27.940 --> 00:05:30.080
Heading contest?

00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:35.850
Yes. See how many times you can keep heading the ball in one minute.

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:38.820
If I win, you'll join the Predators, right?

00:05:38.820 --> 00:05:42.490
Yep. But if I win, you'll give up.

00:05:42.490 --> 00:05:44.490
Are you ready?

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:46.690
Okay.

00:05:51.230 --> 00:05:52.970
I'll have to win!

00:05:54.400 --> 00:05:56.370
Crap!

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:58.700
I'm just getting started!

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:08.150
Wow.

00:06:08.150 --> 00:06:10.850
I heard she was the ace of her previous team,

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:13.190
but she really is amazing.

00:06:15.690 --> 00:06:18.020
Wow, wow.

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:20.960
You didn't drop it even once.

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:23.200
I can keep on going.

00:06:25.460 --> 00:06:27.170
I lost.

00:06:27.170 --> 00:06:28.700
A promise is a promise.

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:30.500
Stop asking me to join.

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:32.000
Erika-chan!

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:32.800
Stop that!

00:06:32.800 --> 00:06:35.910
I didn't want to tell you this,

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:41.780
but I'm trying out for the Kawahara 
International Heavens today after school.

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:43.620
Aoto-kun's team...

00:06:44.220 --> 00:06:49.890
I want to be on a strong team and 
become stronger under a proper coach.

00:06:49.890 --> 00:06:51.020
That's all.

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:55.890
I'm really sorry.

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:02.470
Is my team going to die off?

00:07:03.100 --> 00:07:05.040
What am I feeling down for?

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:09.310
It's still too early to give up, Outa Shou!

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:18.920
Damn.

00:07:27.260 --> 00:07:32.000
No good today, either. It can't be helped.

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:41.710
Eh? Wow.

00:07:42.610 --> 00:07:45.680
This person is the guy I met this morning.

00:07:47.450 --> 00:07:51.250
Isn't he the drunkard who's always at this park?

00:07:52.820 --> 00:07:56.250
But that ball control is amazing.

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:57.960
Why?

00:08:02.260 --> 00:08:04.000
Hey there, lad!

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:05.700
Did I bother you?

00:08:05.700 --> 00:08:07.300
Sorry about that.

00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:08.600
No...

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:26.590
Later.

00:08:26.590 --> 00:08:27.890
Please wait!

00:08:27.890 --> 00:08:29.590
You're amazing!

00:08:29.590 --> 00:08:31.860
Can you show me that again?

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:33.490
Please, Uncle!

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:34.460
Uncle?

00:08:34.460 --> 00:08:37.600
Who're you calling "Uncle"?{Who's the old man?}

00:08:37.600 --> 00:08:39.100
Sorry.

00:08:39.100 --> 00:08:41.570
That was pure luck. Pure coincidence.

00:08:41.570 --> 00:08:43.440
No, it wasn't!

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:45.670
It's as if the ball was glued to your feet!

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:47.340
That beautiful ball rotation, too!

00:08:48.910 --> 00:08:51.280
I'm Outa Shou!

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:53.910
I'm always practicing here!

00:08:53.910 --> 00:08:55.380
I know.

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:57.680
I often see you here.

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:03.620
You were getting badly beaten by this quick girl and her dog.

00:09:04.860 --> 00:09:07.690
I want to become great like them!

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:10.200
Please teach me!

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:15.530
Sorry, but I don't know anything about soccer.

00:09:15.530 --> 00:09:17.470
I'm not interested, either.

00:09:17.470 --> 00:09:19.370
I'm also no good at teaching.

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:21.270
No way.

00:09:21.270 --> 00:09:22.810
Please!

00:09:22.810 --> 00:09:25.710
I just can't head the ball!

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:30.820
I-I'll try it again! Please watch!

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:34.050
Crap...

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:36.620
Coach! Please watch me head the ball!

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:38.460
I've practiced!

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:41.930
One more time!

00:09:53.740 --> 00:09:54.740
No good.

00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:58.580
That's no good!

00:10:00.650 --> 00:10:03.450
Who was your coach!?

00:10:03.450 --> 00:10:05.620
That heading is too dangerous!

00:10:06.790 --> 00:10:08.320
I don't have a coach.

00:10:09.490 --> 00:10:13.090
The sixth grade club I was in disbanded.

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:16.330
I want to create my own team.

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:17.960
Really?

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:24.340
But before that, you need to fix that heading.

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:30.140
If you head the ball between your eyes, you'll be forced to close them.

00:10:30.140 --> 00:10:32.080
You'll never get any accuracy like that.

00:10:32.680 --> 00:10:36.880
You should head the ball with the dead center of your forehead.

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:41.650
Your way of heading is terrible and has a high chance of damaging your brain.

00:10:43.690 --> 00:10:45.590
Anyway, you need to change your heading technique.

00:10:45.590 --> 00:10:48.660
You do know how to play soccer, Uncle!

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:51.930
I'm not that old.

00:10:51.930 --> 00:10:53.630
Sorry about that.

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:56.300
I do know a bit about soccer.

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:57.940
I knew it!

00:10:57.940 --> 00:11:00.540
But I've left the soccer world a long time ago.

00:11:00.540 --> 00:11:02.210
Eh? Why?

00:11:02.210 --> 00:11:03.680
It's a long story.

00:11:03.680 --> 00:11:06.880
In any case, please teach me how to head, at least!

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:10.220
Please! I want to become stronger, no matter what!

00:11:10.220 --> 00:11:14.650
Erika-chan will come back if I become stronger!

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:16.450
My other friends, too!

00:11:16.450 --> 00:11:21.130
Then we can create a team and play soccer again!

00:11:21.130 --> 00:11:24.400
Just for today! Please!

00:11:25.400 --> 00:11:28.070
I'm just a drunkard, as you can see.

00:11:28.070 --> 00:11:32.240
My family runs a BBQ restaurant, so I'm used to drunkards!

00:11:32.240 --> 00:11:33.370
Jeez.

00:11:33.370 --> 00:11:37.080
I lost. Just for today, okay?

00:11:37.080 --> 00:11:41.010
Yes! Thank you very much!

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:48.420
Here I go.

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:52.090
Don't close your eyes! Always keep them on the ball!

00:11:52.090 --> 00:11:53.330
Okay!

00:11:53.330 --> 00:11:54.490
Next!

00:11:55.530 --> 00:11:58.400
The center of your forehead! Not your right!

00:11:58.400 --> 00:11:59.400
Sorry!

00:12:02.470 --> 00:12:03.870
Next!

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:14.950
If you don't look at where you're heading, then it's all pointless.

00:12:14.950 --> 00:12:16.250
Sorry!

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:20.750
Wow. He explains things so simply.

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:23.220
He's completely different from the coaches I've had up until now.

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:24.560
We're not done yet!

00:12:24.560 --> 00:12:25.260
Okay!

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:28.230
Next! Left!

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:31.360
Right!

00:12:34.800 --> 00:12:35.900
I'm fine!

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:39.070
Please! I can keep on going!

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:41.070
Okay. Let's go.

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:41.770
Okay!

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:47.710
Last one!

00:12:55.520 --> 00:12:57.490
Here. It's my treat.

00:12:57.490 --> 00:12:59.120
Thank you very much.

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:05.600
You really chugged that down.

00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:08.900
Now I'm a bit closer to Erika-chan.

00:13:08.900 --> 00:13:13.000
"You'll see a man with new eyes after three days."{"You should see me with new eyes after three days."}

00:13:14.110 --> 00:13:17.740
It's only been one day, though. 
But you've improved quite a bit.

00:13:17.740 --> 00:13:21.080
Now I have to find a way to persuade the Furuyas.

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:23.210
The guys you were talking about?

00:13:23.210 --> 00:13:25.120
Are they that good?

00:13:25.120 --> 00:13:28.850
Yes! They got called to the national 
training camp when they were in fifth grade!

00:13:29.920 --> 00:13:33.930
They were even invited to the New Tokyo FC's junior team.

00:13:34.930 --> 00:13:37.660
The Amarillos? That's pretty good.

00:13:37.660 --> 00:13:42.300
Um, will you be here tomorrow?

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:43.300
I don't know.

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:46.440
I'll bring Erika-chan tomorrow!

00:13:46.440 --> 00:13:49.470
After that, please become our coach!

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:51.080
Me, a coach?

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:56.650
Yes! If we have a great coach,
 everyone will come back to the team for sure!{Yes! With a great coach, everyone will come back to the team!}

00:13:56.650 --> 00:14:00.620
I told you that I've left the soccer world already.

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:02.590
Today was an exception.

00:14:02.590 --> 00:14:03.560
But...

00:14:03.560 --> 00:14:05.490
Hold it. Listen up.

00:14:05.490 --> 00:14:06.990
Masaru-chan!

00:14:08.130 --> 00:14:12.100
I've been looking for you! What were you doing here?

00:14:12.100 --> 00:14:13.630
Oh? Who's the boy?

00:14:13.630 --> 00:14:16.840
Passerby boy A.

00:14:16.840 --> 00:14:19.300
Weren't you at the training camp for badminton?

00:14:19.300 --> 00:14:20.770
We finished today.

00:14:20.770 --> 00:14:24.010
Really? Let's go. I'm hungry.

00:14:24.010 --> 00:14:25.240
Good evening.

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:26.380
Good evening.

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:27.380
Kyouko!

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:29.010
Uh, later!

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:34.650
Thank you very much, Masaru-ojisan.

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:38.420
What? You found an awesome coach!?

00:14:38.420 --> 00:14:42.990
Yep. He's really good at teaching, and I'm sure you'll like him!

00:14:42.990 --> 00:14:47.970
Really? You sure you aren't bluffing again?

00:14:47.970 --> 00:14:49.500
Just watch.

00:14:52.440 --> 00:14:54.370
Eh!?

00:14:56.270 --> 00:14:57.480
Let's have another match.

00:14:57.480 --> 00:14:59.780
Hey! You're getting cocky!

00:14:59.780 --> 00:15:01.780
You won't beat me in a million years.

00:15:01.780 --> 00:15:05.050
But you did get a lot better. That surprised me.

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:09.390
"You'll see a man with new eyes after three days."{"You should see me with new eyes after three days!"}

00:15:09.390 --> 00:15:13.890
What? You'll see a woman with new eyes after three days, too!

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:16.660
Erika-chan, that was a proverb...

00:15:16.660 --> 00:15:17.630
Who cares!

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:20.670
I met Heavens' head coach yesterday.

00:15:22.070 --> 00:15:24.540
"You're a girl, so please go home." {~}

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:27.040
He thought I was an idiot!

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:29.610
You're really good though.

00:15:29.610 --> 00:15:31.980
You couldn't join the Heavens!?

00:15:31.980 --> 00:15:33.580
Don't sound so happy!

00:15:33.580 --> 00:15:39.950
Don't worry. If we get him to be our 
coach, the triplets will definitely come back!

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:45.790
Let me go see him first, then.

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:52.930
Uncle! Wake up! Uncle!

00:15:53.670 --> 00:15:56.370
He looks like any old drunkard.

00:15:56.370 --> 00:15:58.700
No, but yesterday...

00:15:58.700 --> 00:16:00.440
Wait right there!

00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:02.510
Stop running away!

00:16:03.880 --> 00:16:05.680
Even if you ask us...

00:16:05.680 --> 00:16:07.610
...we don't want to do this!

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:08.950
You two...

00:16:08.950 --> 00:16:10.480
Suguro-kun!

00:16:10.480 --> 00:16:13.020
You're Suguro-kun from Tsubaki Forest FC, right?

00:16:13.020 --> 00:16:15.390
You're from the Predators...

00:16:15.390 --> 00:16:18.720
There's a lot of things I need to tell you!

00:16:20.060 --> 00:16:24.530
Please stop that. He's my former teammate.

00:16:24.530 --> 00:16:25.930
Ryuuji-kun!

00:16:25.930 --> 00:16:28.200
Oh, it's the Furuyas.

00:16:28.200 --> 00:16:29.830
Isn't this Shou and Takatou?

00:16:29.830 --> 00:16:32.240
What are you doing here?

00:16:32.240 --> 00:16:34.040
Who cares!

00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:36.510
I heard you played in a practice match with Rosa!

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:40.580
You played with a professional team! 
Why aren't you coming back to soccer!?

00:16:41.550 --> 00:16:43.720
I thought I could challenge you three again!

00:16:43.720 --> 00:16:47.220
We were just playing around. We're free to 
choose whether we want to come back or not.

00:16:47.220 --> 00:16:48.390
What!?

00:16:48.390 --> 00:16:55.030
Well, Suguro-kun is quite mad 
and wants to play a 3v3 match, but...

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:56.060
...they ran away.{They're gone.}{He picks up where Ryuuji trails off, so joined by ellipsis.}

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:05.140
Shut up... You two! Form a team with me and let's go!

00:17:05.140 --> 00:17:06.070
Eh!?

00:17:09.610 --> 00:17:16.310
We switch sides after a goal or after the ball has been successfully stolen, okay?

00:17:16.310 --> 00:17:18.220
Okay! I got it!

00:17:18.220 --> 00:17:20.720
Will Masaru-ojisan wake up?

00:17:23.050 --> 00:17:28.130
If he becomes our coach, I'm sure the Furuyas...

00:17:31.030 --> 00:17:32.430
Let's go!

00:17:38.040 --> 00:17:38.870
Erika-chan!

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:47.510
What quick defense.

00:17:51.020 --> 00:17:52.420
Shou-kun's no good.

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:53.990
How about this!?

00:17:56.490 --> 00:17:57.220
What!?

00:17:57.220 --> 00:17:58.460
He stole the ball.

00:17:58.460 --> 00:18:00.830
But all I have to do is get it back quickly before he passes.

00:18:06.330 --> 00:18:08.100
Okay, switch sides.

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:14.140
So those are the Furuyas? The triplets?

00:18:14.140 --> 00:18:15.870
Here we go.

00:18:19.380 --> 00:18:21.550
Man-mark them! Don't let them pass!

00:18:21.550 --> 00:18:22.150
Okay!

00:18:25.220 --> 00:18:26.620
You're not getting past me!

00:18:30.090 --> 00:18:34.260
Hey, hey. That roulette's pretty good for a brat.

00:18:34.260 --> 00:18:35.960
Let's go, Ryuuji!

00:18:43.070 --> 00:18:44.500
Goal.

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:45.970
Damn it!{Crap!}

00:18:46.540 --> 00:18:47.940
Okay, Ryuuji.

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:55.950
Masaru-ojisan!

00:18:55.950 --> 00:18:58.020
That's dangerous, old man.

00:18:58.020 --> 00:19:00.650
Hey, old man. You're bothering us. Move aside.

00:19:00.650 --> 00:19:03.090
This guy is really good at soccer.

00:19:03.090 --> 00:19:03.960
What?

00:19:03.960 --> 00:19:05.720
He taught me how to head the ball.

00:19:05.720 --> 00:19:07.430
You know him?

00:19:07.430 --> 00:19:10.930
Oh, old man. Why don't you join Shou's team?

00:19:10.930 --> 00:19:12.000
What?

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:14.170
That makes it more interesting.

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:16.670
3v4 makes it more fair.

00:19:16.670 --> 00:19:18.370
What did you say!?

00:19:18.370 --> 00:19:21.340
What will you do? We don't really mind either way.

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:23.710
All right.

00:19:29.680 --> 00:19:34.990
Am I an idiot? Getting riled up by these brats...

00:19:47.300 --> 00:19:48.030
Shou-kun!

00:19:49.100 --> 00:19:51.570
Let's set up the offense again!

00:19:52.840 --> 00:19:54.310
Uncle!

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:02.450
Uncle! The ball! The ball!

00:20:14.890 --> 00:20:17.160
What's with him? He's not moving at all!

00:20:17.160 --> 00:20:19.600
I've seen him before...

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:29.370
Please, Uncle!

00:20:42.990 --> 00:20:44.860
I'm not an old man.

00:20:49.590 --> 00:20:51.830
I'm... the Lightning Light... Hanashima Masaru!

00:20:51.830 --> 00:20:54.670
I'm... the Lightning Light... Hanashima Masaru!

00:20:54.670 --> 00:20:58.440
I'm... the Lightning Light... Hanashima Masaru!

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:14.250
No way...

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:16.150
Goal!!!

00:21:17.260 --> 00:21:20.930
Wow! Wow! Uncle!

00:21:20.930 --> 00:21:23.360
Uncle?

00:21:23.360 --> 00:21:25.230
I ain't that old.{Old man my ass.}

00:21:33.600 --> 00:21:35.110
Masaru-chan!

00:21:49.420 --> 00:21:52.120
Thank you all for helping me.

00:21:52.120 --> 00:21:56.260
I can't carry this drunkard all by myself.

00:21:56.260 --> 00:21:58.460
Will he be okay?

00:21:58.460 --> 00:22:02.870
I happened to catch a bit of your game, and 
it seems like he didn't move that much. He'll be fine.

00:22:02.870 --> 00:22:05.170
Who is he, anyway?

00:22:05.170 --> 00:22:07.710
That shot was really something.

00:22:07.710 --> 00:22:10.510
Well, uh...

00:22:10.510 --> 00:22:13.910
I want Hanashima-san to be our coach!

00:22:13.910 --> 00:22:15.780
Hey, don't ask so suddenly!

00:22:15.780 --> 00:22:18.480
I've decided after seeing that shot!

00:22:18.480 --> 00:22:21.890
I really want him to be the coach for our new team!

00:22:22.550 --> 00:22:25.820
Sorry. I can't tell you the reason,

00:22:25.820 --> 00:22:30.360
but I don't think he'll accept your offer.

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:40.470
Shou-kun, wait a second.

00:22:40.470 --> 00:22:45.080
If that old man becomes our coach, we'll return to the team.

00:22:45.080 --> 00:22:46.040
Eh?

00:22:46.040 --> 00:22:47.210
Really!?

00:22:47.210 --> 00:22:50.620
That's what Kota-kun's thinking.

00:22:51.520 --> 00:22:53.120
I don't really mind.

00:22:53.120 --> 00:22:54.690
Will we be okay?

00:22:54.690 --> 00:22:56.090
I don't know.

00:22:56.090 --> 00:22:59.960
But I want Hanashima-san to be our coach, too.

00:22:59.960 --> 00:23:01.430
For sure!{I'll make sure of it!}

00:23:01.430 --> 00:23:05.300
This time will be the true revival of the Momoyama Predators!

00:24:34.990 --> 00:24:38.360
Shou-kun! That old man's shooting is really amazing!

00:24:38.360 --> 00:24:41.330
Right? I'll make sure he becomes our coach!

00:24:41.330 --> 00:24:44.100
But he keeps on refusing us. What should we do?

00:24:44.100 --> 00:24:47.000
We tried many ways, but in the end it's all up to our spirit!

00:24:47.000 --> 00:24:49.970
Spirit! Spirit! Spirit!

00:24:49.970 --> 00:24:51.970
Are you some pro sumo wrestler?

00:24:51.970 --> 00:24:55.410
Next time on Ginga e Kickoff! Coach.
